This product bundles PP-OCRv6 small model artifacts from PaddleOCR.
The model copyright is held by Baidu. The ONNX conversions and distribution
metadata are provided by the RapidAI/RapidOCR project. The bundled RTen files
were mechanically converted from those ONNX artifacts by the pylopdf project;
the model graph and weights were not otherwise changed.

